  "problemStatement": "Evaluate int_0^{pi/4} tan(x) sec^2(x) dx.",
  "finalAnswer": "\\int_0^{\\pi/4} \\tan(x) \\sec^2(x) dx = \\frac{1}{2}",
  "steps": [
